WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.300
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.800
Right-click a task…

3
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.600
…Move to Someday

4
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.100
It waits in Someday — out of Today, the plan and reminders

5
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.300
Click Someday to see what's waiting

6
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.800
When you want it back…

7
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:36.300
…Make Active
